-- the same clicks a player makes. GENERATED by tools/poh_test_gen.py from
-- tools/poh_test_template.lua -- edit those, then rerun the generator.
--
-- For the room:
--   place    the room is added for its fee (ground rooms through the starter
--            Parlour's east doorway; basement-only rooms through a Garden
--            dungeon entrance and the corridor below it).
--   build    every tier of every hotspot, in creation-panel order: the
--            materials are taken, the xp is the cache's, the built loc
--            stands on the hotspot. Upgrade-only tiers are made with the
--            built source's Upgrade op instead.
--   persist  Building Mode off (House Options): the house is rebuilt and
--            every piece must still stand where it was built.
--   options  every op the built loc offers (op1..op4) is pressed and must
--            answer -- a message, a dialogue, an interface, an item, a move.
--            "Nothing interesting happens." or silence is a FAIL.
--   remove   Building Mode on, every piece removed, then the room.
